# Choreographed Sparks, both modes (CR 700.2, 608.2c): with Memnite and, in response, Lightning Bolt (aimed at Bot2) on the
# stack, Sparks copies the Bolt (the copy given the new target Bot1) and the creature spell (a hasty token). Bolt copy: Bot1 17;
# Bolt: Bot2 17; the token and the Memnite card both come out, and the token goes at the end step.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Memnite
Lightning Bolt
Choreographed Sparks
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x12

